{"id":"wb-6-631","name":"胜果寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"勝果寺塔","text":"胜果寺塔是一座位于中国河南省焦作市修武县的佛塔。是一座始建于唐代、北宋绍圣年间重修的九级楼阁式砖塔。该塔高约27米，平面呈八角形，塔身逐层收敛。2006年5月25日，胜果寺塔被中华人民共和国国务院公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8B%9D%E6%9E%9C%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":88352897,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88352897","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/47ea710c0ee31770402773a1.jpg","title":"20250719_Pagoda_of_Shengguo_Temple.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250719_Pagoda_of_Shengguo_Temple.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/20250719_Pagoda_of_Shengguo_Temple.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​修武胜果寺塔","width":320,"height":480}}